<title>USA: Capstone to register already-issued shares.</title>
<headline>Capstone to register already-issued shares.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capstone Pharmacy Services Inc said on Tuesday it filed to register 14.1 million previously issued shares with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The shares had been issued in connection with acquisitions or in private placements. Capstone's largest shareholder, Counsel Corp, beneficially owns 8.4 million of these shares to be registered.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
